  <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">As an ordinary resolution, to increase the authorized share capital
to $75,000, with the maximum number of ordinary shares in the capital of the Company and the maximum number of preference shares in the
capital of the Company that the Company is authorized to be increased proportionately, after giving effect to the Share Consolidation,
if applicable.</TD></TR>
