available when you call. Follow the voting instructions to vote your shares.</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; padding-right: 0.05in; padding-bottom: 4pt; padding-left: 0.05in; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; padding-right: 0.05in; padding-bottom: 4pt; padding-left: 0.05in; text-align: center">Mark, sign, and date your proxy card, then detach it and return it
in the postage-paid envelope provided.</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

